{
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Step 2: model, deploy and run\n**Model.** In Desktop Modeler: *File → New file → BPMN diagram (Camunda 8)*. Click the empty canvas and set **ID** `student-request` and **Name** `Student request`. Draw: start event *Request received* → task *Review request* → end event *Request closed*. Make the task a **User task** (wrench icon). Save as `thread-s01.bpmn`.\n\n**Deploy and run.** Rocket icon → *Deploy*. Play icon → *Start instance* (no variables). In Operate (`http://localhost:8080/operate`) open the instance: where is the token? Then in Tasklist (`http://127.0.0.1:8080/tasklist`) open *Review request* → *Assign to me* → *Complete task*. Back in Operate, the instance is completed.\n\nWhen the instance is completed, answer and complete this task.",
      "id": "class_s01_run_0"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Feedback.** {{fbRun}}",
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=fbRun = null or fbRun = \"\""
      },
      "id": "class_s01_run_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "checkpoint1",
      "label": "Checkpoint 1. Before you completed the task, where was the token?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "On the start event Request received",
          "value": "start"
        },
        {
          "label": "On the user task Review request",
          "value": "review"
        },
        {
          "label": "On the end event Request closed",
          "value": "end"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s01_run_2"
    }
  ],
  "type": "default",
  "id": "class-s01-run",
  "executionPlatform": "Camunda Cloud",
  "executionPlatformVersion": "8.9.0",
  "schemaVersion": 18
}
